WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,940
If almond water can make Linghao Weiren incapacitated

2
00:00:02,940 --> 00:00:05,000
Then let’s give almond water to everyone

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:06,300
Everyone takes a sip

4
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:07,800
Will Weiren react?

5
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:10,700
Almond water is only effective for Linghao Weiren

6
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:13,300
I just tried to put a few drops on Huang Mao's back

7
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:15,700
He didn't even lock the chain.

8
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:19,620
What to do next

9
00:00:19,620 --> 00:00:21,420
Eat something to restore your strength first

10
00:00:21,420 --> 00:00:22,820
Make other plans

11
00:00:22,820 --> 00:00:43,480
You are the worst, brother

12
00:00:43,480 --> 00:00:46,200
It kind of saved my life.
